## 封面截取

```javascript
async function captureCover(html) {
  return new Promise((resolve) => {
    try {
      const iframe = document.createElement('iframe');
      iframe.style.cssText = 'position:fixed;left:-9999px;top:-9999px;width:640px;height:360px;border:none;';
      iframe.sandbox = 'allow-scripts allow-same-origin';
      iframe.srcdoc = html;
      document.body.appendChild(iframe);

      setTimeout(() => {
        let result = null;
        try {
          const canvas = iframe.contentDocument?.querySelector('canvas');
          if (canvas && canvas.width > 0) {
            const c2 = document.createElement('canvas');
            c2.width = 320;
            c2.height = 180;
            const ctx = c2.getContext('2d', { alpha: false });
            ctx.fillStyle = '#000';
            ctx.fillRect(0, 0, 320, 180);
            ctx.drawImage(canvas, 0, 0, 320, 180);
            result = c2.toDataURL('image/jpeg', 0.7);
          }
        } catch {}
        iframe.remove();
        resolve(result);
      }, 1200);
    } catch {
      resolve(null);
    }
  });
}
```

### 为什么等 1200ms

动画通常在前几帧就画出内容。1200ms 足够覆盖初始化。等太久浪费，等太短可能截到空白。

